## 🔗 URL Parameters for Testing

Use these URL parameters to customize the prototype for different testing scenarios:

```
Base URL: https://evercred-prototype-production.up.railway.app/
```

### Available Parameters

| Parameter | Effect | Example |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| `?skipWelcome=true` | Skip the welcome modal | Direct to prototype |
| `?hideTokens=true` | Hide token display | Removes token count from header |
| `?minimal=true` | Minimal UI mode | Skip welcome + collapsed tour |

### Recommended URLs for Testing

**Standard user test (guided):**
```
https://evercred-prototype-production.up.railway.app/
```

**Quick demo (skip intro):**
```
https://evercred-prototype-production.up.railway.app/?skipWelcome=true
```

**Minimal mode (experienced users):**
```
https://evercred-prototype-production.up.railway.app/?minimal=true
```

**Hide pricing (focus on workflow):**
```
https://evercred-prototype-production.up.railway.app/?hideTokens=true
```

**Combined options:**
```
https://evercred-prototype-production.up.railway.app/?skipWelcome=true&hideTokens=true
```

