## ⌨️ Keyboard Shortcuts for Moderators

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `T` | Toggle tour panel (show/hide) |
| `Esc` | Minimize tour panel |
| `Ctrl+Shift+R` | Reset demo (reload page) |

