## 📋 Modal Stacking Order

Modals now stack properly with progressive z-indexes:

| Layer | Z-Index | Modals |
|-------|---------|--------|
| Base | `z-50` | Credential Detail, Request Credentials, Cost Confirmation |
| Nested | `z-[60]` | View Proof, Document Preview |
| Tour | `z-[1002]` | Tour panel |
| Welcome | `z-[2000]` | Welcome modal |
| Version Info | `z-[2001]` | Version information modal |

**Result:** Clicking "View Proof" from within Credential Detail now displays correctly on top.

